Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Death energy here is really thick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the killing intent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is at least 10 times fiercer than outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,A newcomer !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He looks so clean and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's got the kind of skin I love peeling the most !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the scent of a newcomer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perfect, time to kill another one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and drink his blood !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are all felons awaiting their execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Wang, you can do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many Life Seals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can make with these prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,000)\pos(145,432)}5 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I felt an intense killing intent earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there is another secret
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,beneath this Hong Prison ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Slaughter Art
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,uses strands of killing intent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,to refine Life Seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have killed all of them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,but only gained some useless Death energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What am I missing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because you don't have enough urge to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't immerse yourself in slaughter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,to refine a Killing Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will not be able to generate enough killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you try, it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refine the heart through killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,transform the heart into a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is my Demon Slaughter Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you wish to learn the true Demon Slaughter Dao,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can grant you an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But whether you can use it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,will depend on your own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the condition ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a warden,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cannot leave the Hong Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you succeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want you to use your slaughter spell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to kill the Demon General Shi Xiao !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful killing intent !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's enough to stimulate my own killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems he wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where the Demon Emperor's sword is nourished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:10.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1607,495)}Slaughter Blood Pool\NHong Prison
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place was created by the Emperor himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The killing intent here is so fierce
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,that it can invade your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If your heart isn't strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you will end up like them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and turn into a walking corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a one-way ticket,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,have you thought it through ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nourish the Demon Emperor's sword ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a great place for slaughter !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This slaughter energy condensed from killing intent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be perfect for cultivating the Celestial Slaughter Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why am I unable to use it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:44.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there isn't enough slaughter energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:24.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)\pos(149,432)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm still wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the method to transform this slaughter energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,into strands of killing intent ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who's there !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could he be trapped here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,with such a cultivation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such fierce sword energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this silver dragon the Emperor's sword ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Release me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me out !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,To leave this place
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must pass the Emperor's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder he said it was a one way ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's sword is strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no way of fighting it head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the slaughter energy is used to nourish the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that same slaughter energy is born from prisoners killing each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,then it stops if they all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would the Emperor's sword destroy its own food source ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this blood pool, no one is able to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The prisoners fight endlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to provide an endless supply of slaughter energy for the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who knows how many years these people have been trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must master the Celestial Slaughter Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's my only way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:03.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now die !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't get out !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,What am I missing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Transform Death into Life
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,and back into Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This perpetual cycle nourishes the Emperor's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Slaughter Art
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is an imitation of a celestial spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It matches with your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life and Death Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use killing intent to take lives
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and refine that life into a Life Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Create Life with Death
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Death with Life !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Slaughter Art !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm finally free...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,You actually used the blood pool to your advantage !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the key to the Celestial Slaughter Art
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,was the Life and Death Reincarnation Cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:36.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's sword is coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Killing intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even Demon Generals
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,are unable to block
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Emperor's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,From Life to Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life Seals !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He actually withstood the Emperor's sword !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:12.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1608,488)\fad(300,300)}Sword Hall\NSky Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1655,471)}Demon Emperor's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of grievance has she suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cause such anger ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's sword is angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,A disaster is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and blood will flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,How powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you two think
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(995,557)\fad(300,000)}Hai Zhu\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1622,557)\fad(300,000)}Wei Yang\NDa Lou Sword Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,this sword is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:48.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not inferior to Master's swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1557,523)}Mo Fei\NDemon General\NRank 250 000 Demonic Energy\N(Peak Late stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the direction of...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Hong Prison !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,couldn't possibly be heading for Wang Lin, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Wang Lin's cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could he offend the Emperor's sword ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must be overthinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:19.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't leave now if you want to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:21.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've stirred up a huge mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did this guy manage to attract the Emperor's sword ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he gets caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be implicated too...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry, go !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And don't forget our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there a place for secluded cultivation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:08.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:13.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it really was him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(143,432)}5 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,My 3792 Life Seals
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:05.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:05.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:11.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:11.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:16.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:22.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:28.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:28.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:33.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:33.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:39.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:39.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:44.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:47.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:50.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:56.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:56.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:59.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:02.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:07.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:07.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:10.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:13.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:18.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:18.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:22.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:25.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:31.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:31.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
